[PrintTextModified Text:『焼却炉で拾った』|#0202Adv20_AnAn008| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:『１枚だけ他の絵と違って輝いて見えた』|#0202Adv20_AnAn009| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:『この絵は、ノアが描いたのか？』|#0202Adv20_AnAn010| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1,ArmR1,ArmL1,ArmR1-Option-All,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR1-Option-All

[PrintTextModified Text:……うん。|#0202Adv20_Noah011| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……どうして。|#0202Adv20_AnAn011| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1,Arms2,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms01_01,Angle01/Option_ArmR/Option_ArmR01_01-

[PrintTextModified Text:『どうして捨てたんだ？』|#0202Adv20_AnAn012| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Flushed1

[PrintTextModified Text:……だってヘタクソだもん。|#0202Adv20_Noah012| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

